{"id":"demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane","lines":[{"t":3.484,"end":7.828,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Wind Breathing, Fourth Form…","de":"Wind Atmung, vierte Form …","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":8.46,"end":11.004,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Rising Dust Storm","de":"Aufsteigender Staubzyklon","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":11.097,"end":16.545,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Serpent Breathing, Fifth Form: Slithering Serpent","de":"Schlangen Atmung, fünfte Form: Gewundene Schlange","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":17.72,"end":18.7,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"(line 04)","de":"*getroffen werden*","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":19.82,"end":22.22,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"\"New voice line clip caption\"","de":"*atmen","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":22.224,"end":24,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Guess we're even","de":"Wieder Unentschieden...","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":23.936,"end":26,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Seems like it, doesn't it","de":"Sieht ganz so aus, was?","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":27.575,"end":29.623,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"I'd like to join in on the fun too","de":"Wie siehts aus darf ich auch mitmachen?","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":30.276,"end":32,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Tokito, huh","de":"Muichiro...","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":32.761,"end":36.317,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"You come all this way out here to spar with us every day","de":"Du bist ja nicht gerade in der nähe, und nimmst den weg jede nacht auf dich","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":36.375,"end":39.567,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Isn't this affecting your daytime training?","de":"Na hoffentlich bist du morgen auch wieder fit fürs training","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":39.567,"end":43.185,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"Well, it might be sufficient training for the other members","de":"De truppenmitglieder die ich trainiere bekommen von all dem nichts mit","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":43.185,"end":45.497,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"It's not quite enough to satisfy me","de":"Außerdem fordert mich das training mitihnen nicht","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":45.497,"end":47.377,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"Heh, well yeah","de":"Heh, verständlich","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":47.149,"end":47.849,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"\"New voice line clip caption\"","de":"heh","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":47.681,"end":52.433,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"That's why we come out here, because this is the real Hashira training for us","de":"das tägliche training bringt nichts. wir machen nur fortschritte wenn wir uns gegenseitig herausfordern","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":52.496,"end":56.7,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"Yeah, but it's not fair to keep this just to yourselves","de":"Ach so... dann sollten wir die nettigkeiten ablegen, und mal ernst machen","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":56.786,"end":65.41,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Anyway, out of respect for your effort, Tokito, Shinazugawa and I decided we'll be taking you on two against one","de":"Einverstanden.. und als zeichen unserer anerkennung... werden sanemi und ich... zu zweit gegen dich antretten. Alles klar?","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":65.41,"end":66.795,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Let's go","de":"Und Los Gehts!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":66.8,"end":70.312,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"Two against one, huh? That's no fair","de":"Zwei gegen einen, ja? Wie unfair","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":70.37,"end":73.498,"chars":[2],"who":"Muichiro","text":"If you say so. Ready?","de":"Aber gut... haltet euch... Bereit!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":74.791,"end":76.327,"chars":[1],"who":"Obanai","text":"Hmph?!","de":"Hmpf?!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":76.7,"end":77.9,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"\"New voice line clip caption\"","de":"*verwirrt*","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":77.86,"end":80.36,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"\"New voice line clip caption\"","de":"*ausholen zum schlag, und dann zuschlagen*","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":80.777,"end":82.377,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"\"New voice line clip caption\"","de":"*weggeworfen werden*","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":90,"end":95.732,"chars":[3],"who":"Kasugai Crow","text":"Nice work! They can hardly keep up with you! Show them how a real hashira fights!","de":"Weiter so! Mach die beiden Fertig! du bist einfach unvergleichlich!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":95.199,"end":96.735,"chars":[0],"who":"Sanemi","text":"SHUT UP!","de":"SCHNABEL!","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":96.502,"end":97.926,"chars":[3],"who":"Kasugai Crow","text":"HAAAAA","de":"HAAA","orig":"scenes/demon_slayer_hashira_training_drill_sane/lines/28.mp3"}]}